"Flexible Timers is operated by Xintech LLC. Flexible Timers may send SMS\n      messages only to a phone number that a signed-in user adds, verifies, and\n      opts into as their own account phone number. The current SMS program is\n      limited to account phone verification codes and user-created timer/reminder\n      SMS that the user schedules for themselves. Flexible Timers does not send\n      marketing text messages and does not allow users to send SMS to arbitrary\n      third-party recipients. Flexible Timers SMS is not a two-way chat or\n      conversation service; inbound keywords are used only for STOP, HELP, START,\n      and YES compliance handling." = "Flexible Timers 由 Xintech LLC 运营。Flexible Timers 只会向登录用户\n      添加、验证并选择作为自己账户电话号码的号码发送 SMS 消息。\n      目前的 SMS 计划仅包括账户电话验证码，以及用户为自己创建和\n      安排的计时器/提醒 SMS。Flexible Timers 不发送营销短信，也不允许\n      用户向任意第三方收件人发送 SMS。Flexible Timers SMS 不是双向\n      聊天或对话服务；入站关键词仅用于 STOP、HELP、START 和 YES\n      合规处理。";
